81" end="00:10.007">dead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.255" end="00:13.928"><span begin="00:10.255" end="00:10.479">So </span><span begin="00:10.847" end="00:11.112">you </span><span begin="00:11.112" end="00:11.383">show </span><span begin="00:11.383" end="00:11.671">up </span><span begin="00:11.671" end="00:11.919">at </span><span begin="00:11.919" end="00:12.279">my </span><span begin="00:12.279" end="00:12.511">home </span><span begin="00:12.791" end="00:13.119">all </span><span begin="00:13.119" end="00:13.615">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.928" end="00:17.033"><span begin="00:13.928" end="00:14.175">With </span><span begin="00:14.175" end="00:14.462">a </span><span begin="00:14.462" end="00:15.007">shovel </span><span begin="00:15.007" end="00:15.274">and </span><span begin="00:15.274" end="00:15.600">a </span><span begin="00:15.600" end="00:15.909">rose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.033" end="00:19.204"><span begin="00:17.033" end="00:17.301">Do </span><span begin="00:17.301" end="00:17.613">you </span><span begin="00:17.613" end="00:18.086">think </span><span begin="00:18.086" end="00:18.365">I'm </span><span begin="00:18.365" end="00:18.671">a </span><span begin="00:18.671" end="00:19.096">joke</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.204" end="00:22.549"><span begin="00:19.204" end="00:19.476">'Cause </span><span begin="00:20.076" end="00:20.308">people </span><span begin="00:20.308" end="00:20.597">like </span><span begin="00:20.597" end="00:20.884">you </span><span begin="00:20.884" end="00:21.207">always </span><span begin="00:21.207" end="00:21.484">want </span><span begin="00:21.484" end="00:21.717">back </span><span begin="00:21.717" end="00:21.862">what </span><span begin="00:21.862" end="00:21.990">they </span><span begin="00:21.990" end="00:22.265">can't </span><span begin="00:22.265" end="00:22.528">have</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.549" end="00:24.250"><span begin="00:22.549" end="00:22.709">But </span><span begin="00:22.709" end="00:22.893">I'm </span><span begin="00:22.893" end="00:23.135">past </span><span begin="00:23.135" end="00:23.325">that </span><span begin="00:23.325" end="00:23.501">and </span><span begin="00:23.501" end="00:23.686">you </span><span begin="00:23.686" end="00:23.957">know </span><span begin="00:23.957" end="00:24.109">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.250" end="00:28.091"><span begin="00:24.250" end="00:24.506">So </span><span begin="00:24.506" end="00:24.650">you </span><span begin="00:24.650" end="00:24.789">should </span><span begin="00:24.789" end="00:25.083">turn </span><span begin="00:25.083" end="00:25.355">back </span><span begin="00:25.355" end="00:25.480">to </span><span begin="00:25.480" end="00:25.650">your </span><span begin="00:25.650" end="00:25.907">rat </span><span begin="00:25.907" end="00:26.137">pack </span><span begin="00:26.137" end="00:26.276">tell </span><span begin="00:26.276" end="00:26.436">'em </span><span begin="00:26.436" end="00:26.748">I'm </span><span begin="00:26.748" end="00:27.060">trash</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.091" end="00:32.517"><span begin="00:28.091" end="00:28.288">Tell </span><span begin="00:28.288" end="00:28.488">all </span><span begin="00:28.488" end="00:28.632">of </span><span begin="00:28.632" end="00:28.936">your </span><span begin="00:28.936" end="00:29.287">friends </span><span begin="00:29.287" end="00:29.664">that </span><span begin="00:29.880" end="00:30.000">I'm </span><span begin="00:30.000" end="00:30.696">crazy </span><span begin="00:30.857" end="00:31.153">and </span><span begin="00:31.153" end="00:31.551">drive </span><span begin="00:31.551" end="00:31.928">you </span><span begin="00:31.928" end="00:32.248">mad</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.517" end="00:36.884"><span begin="00:32.517" end="00:32.675">That </span><span begin="00:32.675" end="00:32.923">I'm </span><span begin="00:32.923" end="00:33.072">such </span><span begin="00:33.072" end="00:33.344">a </span><span begin="00:33.344" end="00:33.879">stalker </span><span begin="00:34.187" end="00:34.475">a </span><span begin="00:34.475" end="00:35.000">watcher </span><span begin="00:35.281" end="00:35.592">a </span><span begin="00:35.592" end="00:36.676">psychopath</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.884" end="00:41.379"><span begin="00:36.884" end="00:37.076">And </span><span begin="00:37.076" end="00:37.340">tell </span><span begin="00:37.340" end="00:37.500">them </span><span begin="00:37.500" end="00:37.820">you </span><span begin="00:37.820" end="00:38.228">hate </span><span begin="00:38.228" end="00:38.412">me </span><span begin="00:38.636" end="00:38.933">and </span><span begin="00:38.933" end="00:39.425">dated </span><span begin="00:39.754" end="00:40.018">me </span><span begin="00:40.018" end="00:40.405">just </span><span begin="00:40.405" end="00:40.818">for </span><span begin="00:40.818" end="00:41.155">laughs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.379" end="00:45.901"><span begin="00:41.379" end="00:41.580">So </span><span begin="00:41.580" end="00:41.818">why </span><span begin="00:41.818" end="00:42.010">do </span><span begin="00:42.010" end="00:42.259">you </span><span begin="00:42.259" end="00:42.642">call </span><span begin="00:42.642" end="00:42.850">me </span><span begin="00:43.091" end="00:43.362">and </span><span begin="00:43.362" end="00:43.736">tell </span><span begin="00:43.736" end="00:43.899">me </span><span begin="00:44.146" end="00:44.458">you </span><span begin="00:44.458" end="00:44.894">want </span><span begin="00:44.894" end="00:45.298">me </span><span begin="00:45.298" end="00:45.690">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.901" end="00:46.779"><span begin="00:45.901" end="00:46.045">You </span><span begin="00:46.045" end="00:46.560">maniac</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.779" end="00:50.742"><span begin="00:46.779" end="00:48.337">Maniac </span><span begin="00:48.892" end="00:49.458">som