begin="01:04.512" end="01:04.767">You </span><span begin="01:04.767" end="01:05.023">just </span><span begin="01:05.023" end="01:05.296">went </span><span begin="01:05.296" end="01:05.600">too </span><span begin="01:05.600" end="01:05.921">far</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.127" end="01:10.411"><span begin="01:06.127" end="01:06.392">Wrecked </span><span begin="01:06.392" end="01:06.684">your </span><span begin="01:06.684" end="01:06.920">car </span><span begin="01:07.224" end="01:07.504">called </span><span begin="01:07.504" end="01:07.801">me </span><span begin="01:07.801" end="01:08.338">crying </span><span begin="01:08.338" end="01:08.604">in </span><span begin="01:08.604" end="01:08.962">the </span><span begin="01:08.962" end="01:09.337">dark</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.411" end="01:12.475"><span begin="01:10.411" end="01:10.642">Now </span><span begin="01:10.642" end="01:10.881">you're </span><span begin="01:10.881" end="01:11.769">breakin' </span><span begin="01:11.769" end="01:12.025">my </span><span begin="01:12.025" end="01:12.417">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.475" end="01:16.188"><span begin="01:12.475" end="01:12.779">So </span><span begin="01:13.163" end="01:13.355">I </span><span begin="01:13.355" end="01:13.627">show </span><span begin="01:13.627" end="01:13.900">up </span><span begin="01:13.900" end="01:14.180">at </span><span begin="01:14.180" end="01:14.532">your </span><span begin="01:14.532" end="01:14.755">place </span><span begin="01:15.060" end="01:15.348">right </span><span begin="01:15.348" end="01:15.827">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.188" end="01:19.095"><span begin="01:16.188" end="01:16.414">Wipe </span><span begin="01:16.414" end="01:16.693">the </span><span begin="01:16.693" end="01:16.979">tears </span><span begin="01:16.979" end="01:17.244">off </span><span begin="01:17.244" end="01:17.523">of </span><span begin="01:17.523" end="01:17.795">your </span><span begin="01:17.795" en